name: ['Acidic Slime', 'Bloodbraid Elf', 'Bloodghast', 'Echoing Decay', 'Fiery Islet', 'Frost Titan', 'Giver of Runes', 'Grave Titan', 'Inferno Titan', 'Mortarpod', 'Nurturing Peatland', 'Primeval Titan', 'Repeal', 'Silent Clearing', 'Sun Titan', 'Sunbaked Canyon', 'Sword of Fire and Ice', 'Tooth and Nail', 'Tribal Flames', 'Unearth', 'Vendilion Clique', 'Waterlogged Grove', "Wayfarer's Bauble", 'Wild Nacatl', 'Worn Powerstone']
